      "scope": "Thirty-five compiler-authenticated exports preserve copied arrays and records through original native Composer packages on ordinary-source and independently reviewed paths. Each weak/strict PHP execution checks nineteen primitives, seven records and 24 Array levels with 191,516 assertions, 4,317 calls and 67 rejected inputs. Separate installed probes recover from 1,354 conversion/allocation failures and 64 partial inputs, releasing tracked owners and clearing native output exactly once. Isolated FFI conversions reject 803 malformed values; host-only equality checks cover FFI and both Zend integer mappings without claiming native execution for Zend. Original packages remain unchanged. Offline consumers use empty Composer homes and caches and repeat after sources, handoffs and install staging are removed, including the exact documentation example. Independent rebuilds reproduce archives, package-owned files, native libraries and public observations; four Composer-generated deployment files contain installation-specific identities. This receipt promotes native PHP only.",
