      "scope": "Offline installed native PHP Composer consumers cover nineteen primitive callback and returned-function signatures on ordinary-source and independently reviewed paths, with relocated weak and strict callers repeated without compilers. The 63-export fixture passes 51686 assertions per weak/strict caller on each path, repeated twice after installation project/cache removal. Covers exact values through 16385 bits, floats, Unicode, arity 16, original Throwable and trace, copy independence, expired borrows, reentry, deferred close, alias lifetime, destructor recovery, registry exhaustion, fiber and real post-fork rejection. A warmed 20000-call test bounds retained PHP memory. Clover/Juniper Composer and C archives reproduce; cross-package callables, shared runtime and nested exception identity pass. Fresh Shop/Telemetry oracles pass 124 catalog cases on each path in both caller modes. PHP 8.2.33 NTS CLI, Composer 2, GCC 12.2.0; local glibc 2.36, declared package/CI floor 2.38. See docs/evidence/php-callables-20260919.json. PHP-Wasm and copied fields are not promoted. PHP-Wasm callable milestone: generator and fixture source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities remain historical. Fresh callable evidence is recorded separately in php-wasm-callables-installed. WIT callable projection milestone: shared generator, test-manifest and CI source hashes refreshed. Historical archive identities and installed scopes are unchanged; synthetic Component Model probes add no installed callable coverage. See docs/evidence/wit-callable-projection-20260919.md. WIT native-callable milestone: shared generator and gate source hashes refreshed; historical archive identities and installed scopes remain unchanged. New WIT callable evidence is recorded separately in wit-wasi-callables-installed. npm transport staging: shared source hashes refreshed; historical archive identities and installed scopes remain unchanged. See docs/evidence/npm-callable-transport-20260919.md. npm