      "command": "LEAN_BRIDGE_PHP_RECURSIVE_CALLABLE_TEST=1 node --test --test-name-pattern='original recursive' tests/php-recursive-callables.test.mjs && LEAN_BRIDGE_PHP_RECURSIVE_CALLABLE_TEST=1 node --test --test-name-pattern='original mixed' tests/php-recursive-callables.test.mjs",
      "scope": "Original native Composer packages preserve recursive PHP callbacks and owned closures on ordinary-source and reviewed-IR paths. Authors are removed before offline installation into empty caches; relocated weak and strict consumers run after handoffs are removed. Each path passes 1130 public checks and 389 rejections. Host probes pass 1112848 checks with 65884 injected exceptions/errors; native probes pass 22266 checks with 619 injected allocation failures and 170 independent layout values. Five malformed-output cases retire the runtime safely. Pointer ownership is checked before decoding, and deliberate ownership/retirement defects fail at named checks. The 8232 lifetime checks include actual fork rejection, Fiber rules, stale-generation rejection, GC cleanup and capacity recovery. Exact documentation examples and all four native-asset tamper cases pass. Mixed packages add all nineteen primitives and sixteen-argument Unit callbacks, passing 1249 public checks. Original installed packages remain unchanged.",
